dden;display:none">/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/2101nUZY3Gsbazjr7RBiM8/592440a2bb367a486fe5b58cb631998f/os_logo.jpg</div><div data-elastic-name="name" style="visibility:hidden;display:none">Born Tart Raised Bold™ | Ocean Spray®</div><!--$--><section class="module-wrapper_module-wrapper__jQrVK" id="module-2vZTOD5JkJAeUGqdqieAaH" data-module-id="hero-module-homepage-hero-us" data-module-index="0"><div class="hero-story-driven_container__35WST hero-story-driven_is-ready__E7jMj"><div class="hero-story-driven_wrapper__Mpqji"><div class="hero-story-driven_waves__xXnix"></div><div class="hero-story-driven_inner__1qN9h"><div style="--aspect-ratio-portrait:3/4;--aspect-ratio-landscape:16/9" class="image_image__AxgoZ hero-story-driven_image__uJNAH"><img alt="A farmer standing in a flooded bog holding wet cranberries during a harvest." fetchPriority="high" width="2560" height="1440" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-position:50% 50%" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 768px,   (max-width: 1280px) 1280px,   (max-width: 1920px) 1920px,   100vw" srcSet="/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/1Os4xpMtlUb8scTxKcwmIR/4bd3b92655b60c1fe959dd4ac1c0bcf4/home-hero.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=640 640w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/1Os4xpMtlUb8scTxKcwmIR/4bd3b92655b60c1fe959dd4ac1c0bcf4/home-hero.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=750 750w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/1Os4xpMtlUb8scTxKcwmIR/4bd3b92655b60c1fe959dd4ac1c0bcf4/home-hero.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=828 828w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/1Os4xpMtlUb8scTxKcwmIR/4bd3b92655b60c1fe959dd4ac1c0bcf4/home-hero.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1080 1080w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/1Os4xpMtlUb8scTxKcwmIR/4bd3b92655b60c1fe959dd4ac1c0bcf4/home-hero.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1200 1200w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/1Os4xpMtlUb8scTxKcwmIR/4bd3b92655b60c1fe959dd4ac1c0bcf4/home-hero.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1920 1920w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/1Os4xpMtlUb8scTxKcwmIR/4bd3b92655b60c1fe959dd4ac1c0bcf4/home-hero.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=2048 2048w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/1Os4xpMtlUb8scTxKcwmIR/4bd3b92655b60c1fe959dd4ac1c0bcf4/home-hero.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=3840 3840w" src="/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/1Os4xpMtlUb8scTxKcwmIR/4bd3b92655b60c1fe959dd4ac1c0bcf4/home-hero.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=3840"/></div></div><div class="hero-story-driven_heading-body-wrapper__QX_Hq"><div class="heading-wrapper"><h1 class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-h1__Qh3_N hero-story-driven_heading-element__0nW7C"><span class="hero-story-driven_heading-word__R6hxa">BORN</span> <span class="hero-story-driven_heading-word__R6hxa">TART</span> <span class="hero-story-driven_heading-word__R6hxa">RAISED</span> <span class="hero-story-driven_heading-word__R6hxa">BOLD™</span> </h1></div><div class="hero-story-driven_body__UXfAO"><p class="text_text__84aqk text-p text_text-body__eEB__ text_text--size--large__gyIqz hero-story-driven_text__VKKzj">Day one. Three maverick farmers with an appetite for bold beginnings. Today, around 700 family farmers keep that maverick spirit strong.</p><a href="/our-farmers" class="button_button__52Aro button_button-primary__Pzm0i button_button--theme--light__YSRhv hero-story-driven_button__MAfAR"><span class="button_button__inner__t5VMQ">Meet Our Farmers</span></a></div></div><div class="cranberries-parallax_container__2bOS6 cranberries-parallax_in-view__RUJtW" aria-hidden="true"><div class="cranberries-parallax_cranberry__coordinates__BdgKX" style="left:7%;top:37%"><div class="cranberries-parallax_cranberry__parallax__Gg13k cranberries-parallax_cranberry__parallax--2___eM0M"><div class="cranberries-parallax_cranberry__floating__uPX_W" style="animation-delay:-1.4986582153235366s"><div style="width:200px;height:calc(200px * 0.916 )" class="image_image__AxgoZ cranberry-sprite_cranberry-sprite__zSJxW cranberries-parallax_cranberry__sprite__SvSA7 cranberries-parallax_cranberry__sprite--2__I9TGZ"><img alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" width="500" height="458" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="cranberry-sprite_cranberry-sprite__image___v_D