yle="--aspect-ratio-portrait:275/347;--aspect-ratio-landscape:7/9" class="image_image__AxgoZ"><img alt="A group of people stacking canned cranberry sauce." loading="lazy" width="700" height="900" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-position:100% 100%" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 768px,   (max-width: 1280px) 1280px,   (max-width: 1920px) 1920px,   100vw" srcSet="/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7aOZm2IQooPI16BIE0Vyxm/b279b4cec2105a51fa6c7e512084d2f4/cooperative-of-cran-loving-mavericks.jpg?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=640 640w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7aOZm2IQooPI16BIE0Vyxm/b279b4cec2105a51fa6c7e512084d2f4/cooperative-of-cran-loving-mavericks.jpg?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=750 750w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7aOZm2IQooPI16BIE0Vyxm/b279b4cec2105a51fa6c7e512084d2f4/cooperative-of-cran-loving-mavericks.jpg?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=828 828w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7aOZm2IQooPI16BIE0Vyxm/b279b4cec2105a51fa6c7e512084d2f4/cooperative-of-cran-loving-mavericks.jpg?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1080 1080w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7aOZm2IQooPI16BIE0Vyxm/b279b4cec2105a51fa6c7e512084d2f4/cooperative-of-cran-loving-mavericks.jpg?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1200 1200w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7aOZm2IQooPI16BIE0Vyxm/b279b4cec2105a51fa6c7e512084d2f4/cooperative-of-cran-loving-mavericks.jpg?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1920 1920w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7aOZm2IQooPI16BIE0Vyxm/b279b4cec2105a51fa6c7e512084d2f4/cooperative-of-cran-loving-mavericks.jpg?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=2048 2048w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7aOZm2IQooPI16BIE0Vyxm/b279b4cec2105a51fa6c7e512084d2f4/cooperative-of-cran-loving-mavericks.jpg?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=3840 3840w" src="/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7aOZm2IQooPI16BIE0Vyxm/b279b4cec2105a51fa6c7e512084d2f4/cooperative-of-cran-loving-mavericks.jpg?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=3840"/></div></div><div class="fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__text-container__T5ZrS"><h2 class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-h2__OEMhk animated-heading_animated-heading__LhnAB animated-heading_animated-heading--block-reveal___PEyc fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__heading__fAV_P" aria-label="A Cooperative of Cran-Loving Mavericks"><span class="animated-heading__word-wrapper"><span class="animated-heading_animated-heading__word__oXh0q">A</span> <span class="animated-heading_animated-heading__word__oXh0q">Cooperative</span> <span class="animated-heading_animated-heading__word__oXh0q">of</span> <span class="animated-heading_animated-heading__word__oXh0q">Cran-Loving</span> <span class="animated-heading_animated-heading__word__oXh0q">Mavericks</span> </span></h2><div class="animated-container animated-container_animated-container--block-slide__8FtV7 fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__offset-container__hgRh4"><p class="text_text__84aqk text-p text_text-body__eEB__ fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__body-text__Oj_9i">Deliciously innovative. That’s the way it’s been around here since 1930. When three solo farmers knew creating a cooperative was a bolder way to grow. Since then, our family has kept growing so yours can thrive.</p><a href="/about-us/our-purpose" class="button_button__52Aro button_button-primary__Pzm0i button_button--theme--dark__OnuRM fifty-fifty-impact__cta"><span class="button_button__inner__t5VMQ">Find Out More</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="module-wrapper_module-wrapper__jQrVK" id="module-62ICBkX0lhjoKKX1cdrYSL" data-module-id="text-and-image-module-homepage-connecting-farms-to-families" data-module-index="5"><div class="fifty-fifty-impact fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact--text-right__gXAui fifty-fifty-impact_no-illustration__R5I0N" data-theme="dark"><div class="fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__container__mu5qJ"><div class="grid_grid__kcw2v fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__grid__KLnbt"><div class="fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__image-container__u4LPt" style="--background-image:url(&quot;/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7422Nz91zWQk3vKmI6yl7z/f904d2a174afd3d83e3e6acf1c9f730b/image.webp?fm=webp&amp;w=700&amp;q=50&quot;)"><div style="--aspect-ratio-portrait:275/347;--aspect-ratio-landscape:7/9" class="image_image__AxgoZ"><img alt="A farmer stands in a flooded cranberry bog with a tractor in the distance." loading="lazy" width="700" height="900" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-position:44.42857142857143% 22.333333333333332%" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 768px,   (max-width: 1280px) 1280px,   (max-width: 1920px) 1920px,   100vw" srcSet="/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7422Nz91zWQk3vKmI6yl7z/f904d2a174afd3d83e3e6acf1c9f730b/image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=640 640w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7422Nz91zWQk3vKmI6yl7z/f904d2a174afd3d83e3e6acf1c9f730b/image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=750 750w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7422Nz91zWQk3vKmI6yl7z/f904d2a174afd3d83e3e6acf1c9f730b/image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=828 828w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7422Nz91zWQk3vKmI6yl7z/f904d2a174afd3d83e3e6acf1c9f730b/image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1080 1080w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7422Nz91zWQk3vKmI6yl7z/f904d2a174afd3d83e3e6acf1c9f730b/image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1200 1200w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7422Nz91zWQk3vKmI6yl7z/f904d2a174afd3d83e3e6acf1c9f730b/image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1920 1920w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7422Nz91zWQk3vKmI6yl7z/f904d2a174afd3d83e3e6acf1c9f730b/image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=2048 2048w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7422Nz91zWQk3vKmI6yl7z/f904d2a174afd3d83e3e6acf1c9f730b/image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=3840 3840w" src="/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7422Nz91zWQk3vKmI6yl7z/f904d2a174afd3d83e3e6acf1c9f730b/image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=3840"/></div><div class="stamp_stamp___rYfx stamp_stamp--dried-and-true__uNHiy fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__stamp__nW_4_" style="--background-color:#0062bdff;--text-color:#fefbf4ff"><div class="stamp_stamp__container__NRB_j"><div class="stamp_stamp__image__S7lCX"></div></div></div></div><div class="fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__text-container__T5ZrS"><h2 class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-h2__OEMhk animated-heading_animated-heading__LhnAB animated-heading_animated-heading--block-reveal___PEyc fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__heading__fAV_P" aria-label="Connecting Farms to Families"><span class="animated-heading__word-wrapper"><span class="animated-heading_animated-heading__word__oXh0q">Connecting</span> <span class="animated-heading_animated-heading__word__oXh0q">Farms</span> <span class="animated-heading_animated-heading__word__oXh0q">to</span> <span class="animated-heading_animated-heading__word__oXh0q">Families</span> </span></h2><div class="animated-container animated-container_animated-container--block-slide__8FtV7 fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__offset-container__hgRh4"><p class="text_text__84aqk text-p text_text-body__eEB__ fifty-fifty-impact_fifty-fifty-impact__body-text__Oj_9i">Born tart. Raised bold™. A phrase that defines our farmer-owners and the cranberries they care for.

Generations of planet-friendly crops passed down from one maverick family to the next.</p><a href="/our-farmers" class="button_button__52Aro button_button-primary__Pzm0i button_button--theme--dark__OnuRM fifty-fifty-impact__cta"><span class="button_button__inner__t5VMQ">Find Out More</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="module-wrapper_module-wrapper__jQrVK" id="module-2pK4TABZ4Vdz97tCgOJOUJ" data-module-id="category-routing-module-homepage-multi-product-us" data-module-index="6" data-bg-color="deep-navy" data-theme="dark"><div class="multi-product-carousel_multi-product-carousel__jbd9J"><div class="multi-product-carousel_multi-product-carousel__background__JCQrh" style="--mask-texture-background-color:#00123dff"><span class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-d2__wOKHx heading_heading--stroke__Mp7YE heading_heading--stroke-lilac__smRGL multi-product-carousel_single-product-carousel__background-heading__TtJI2" aria-hidden="true">Wild &amp; Fresh</span></div><div class="grid_grid__kcw2v grid_grid--type--flexible__Iy2wS multi-product-carousel_multi-product-carousel__content__r05vG"><div class="multi-product-carousel_multi-product-carousel__content-heading___Md5_"><h2 class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-h2__OEMhk multi-product-carousel_multi-product-carousel__content-heading-text__IRPCx">Juices &amp; juice drinks</h2></div><div class="multi-product-carousel_multi-product-carousel__content-slider__Hg57r"><!--$--><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--><!--/$--></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="module-wrapper_module-wrapper__jQrVK" id="module-4ImfHrHT824K9qliDmzli" data-module-id="text-module-homepage-people-first" data-module-index="7" data-bg-color="cerulean-blue" data-theme="dark"><div class="evergreen-text_evergreen-text__2nTSx" style="background-color:#0062bdff"><div class="evergreen-text_evergreen-text__illustration__T6Rqt evergreen-text_evergreen-text__cranberriesbunch__O944A"></div><div class="evergreen-text_evergreen-text__container__STpMd"><div class="evergreen-text_evergreen-text__content-container__9zeyn"><div class="evergreen-text_evergreen-text__heading-container__GxiU3"><h2 class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-d4__KV82t evergreen-text_evergreen-text__heading__ToSfy">People First and Planet Friendly</h2><div class="stamp_stamp___rYfx stamp_stamp--for-the-love-of-cran__oBDbE evergreen-text_evergreen-text__stamp__E_RHr" style="--background-color:#ec4f4cff;--text-color:#fefbf4ff"><div class="stamp_stamp__container__NRB_j"><div class="stamp_stamp__image__S7lCX"></div></div></div></div><p class="text_text__84aqk text-p text_text-body__eEB__ evergreen-text_evergreen-text__body-text__aZINx">We won’t speak for everyone. To us, products taste better when served with a side of purpose. So let’s talk about it.</p><a href="/about-us/our-purpose" class="button_button__52Aro button_button-primary__Pzm0i button_button--theme--light__YSRhv"><span class="button_button__inner__t5VMQ">Find Out More</span></a></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="module-wrapper_module-wrapper__jQrVK" id="module-75Ied2n7t1v2rKWfYTTBVV" data-module-id="text-and-image-module-layered-evergreen-text-right" data-module-index="8" data-bg-color="off-white" data-theme="light"><div class="text-right_text-right__mcah1 text-right_layered-evergreen--off-white__Z_ybk" style="background-color:#fefbf4ff"><div class="text-right_outer-container__PnF7S"><div class="grid_grid__kcw2v grid_grid--type--flexible__Iy2wS text-right_grid-container__LoHak"><div class="text-right_image-container__fRAyY" style="--background-image:url(&quot;/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4xmZPSg4aCiBswxTPdehGQ/9d98aae6cb46e616d1d66d05fe98335f/layered-evergreen-text-right-image.webp&quot;)"><div style="--aspect-ratio-portrait:292/441;--aspect-ratio-landscape:811/1020" class="image_image__AxgoZ"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1049" height="1530" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-position:50% 50%" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 768px,   (max-width: 1280px) 1280px,   (max-width: 1920px) 1920px,   100vw" srcSet="/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4xmZPSg4aCiBswxTPdehGQ/9d98aae6cb46e616d1d66d05fe98335f/layered-evergreen-text-right-image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=640 640w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4xmZPSg4aCiBswxTPdehGQ/9d98aae6cb46e616d1d66d05fe98335f/layered-evergreen-text-right-image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=750 750w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4xmZPSg4aCiBswxTPdehGQ/9d98aae6cb46e616d1d66d05fe98335f/layered-evergreen-text-right-image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=828 828w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4xmZPSg4aCiBswxTPdehGQ/9d98aae6cb46e616d1d66d05fe98335f/layered-evergreen-text-right-image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1080 1080w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4xmZPSg4aCiBswxTPdehGQ/9d98aae6cb46e616d1d66d05fe98335f/layered-evergreen-text-right-image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1200 1200w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4xmZPSg4aCiBswxTPdehGQ/9d98aae6cb46e616d1d66d05fe98335f/layered-evergreen-text-right-image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=1920 1920w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4xmZPSg4aCiBswxTPdehGQ/9d98aae6cb46e616d1d66d05fe98335f/layered-evergreen-text-right-image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=2048 2048w, /ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4xmZPSg4aCiBswxTPdehGQ/9d98aae6cb46e616d1d66d05fe98335f/layered-evergreen-text-right-image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=3840 3840w" src="/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4xmZPSg4aCiBswxTPdehGQ/9d98aae6cb46e616d1d66d05fe98335f/layered-evergreen-text-right-image.webp?fm=webp&amp;q=75&amp;w=3840"/></div></div><div class="text-right_inner-container__w23k2"><div class="text-right_background-text__JN6Dq" aria-hidden="true"><div class="background-text-line text-right_background-text-line-1__74LIX"><span class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-d2__wOKHx heading_heading--stroke__Mp7YE heading_heading--stroke-inherit__6Bz6v text-right_background-text-word__ViuFw" aria-hidden="true">The</span></div><div class="background-text-line text-right_background-text-line-2__ArEIi"><span class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-d2__wOKHx heading_heading--stroke__Mp7YE heading_heading--stroke-inherit__6Bz6v text-right_background-text-word__ViuFw" aria-hidden="true">mighty</span></div><div class="background-text-line text-right_background-text-line-3__SXFSU"><span class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-d2__wOKHx heading_heading--stroke__Mp7YE heading_heading--stroke-inherit__6Bz6v text-right_background-text-word__ViuFw" aria-hidden="true">cran</span></div></div><div class="text-right_text-container__O6CfK"><div class="text-right_text-container--texture__27_6d"></div><div class="text-right_text-container-outer__Yvuaf"><div class="text-right_text-container-inner__RaiFO"><h2 class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-h6__X9ss7 text-right_heading__4F7tY">Tiny? Yes. Mighty? Also Yes.</h2><p class="text_text__84aqk text-p text_text-body__eEB__ text_text--size--small__dmBA2 text-right_body-text__C3O5O">Cranberries are loaded with helpful and healthful stuff to keep you feeling mighty. Antioxidant-rich. So, yeah, the cranberry may look tiny, but tiny goes a long way.</p><a href="/the-harvest" class="button_button__52Aro button_button-primary__Pzm0i button_button--theme--light__YSRhv"><span class="button_button__inner__t5VMQ">Find Out More</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="module-wrapper_module-wrapper__jQrVK" id="module-39riZgxyk1l4keq2XJrmEv" data-module-id="ugc-module-ugc-carousel" data-module-index="9" data-bg-color="red" data-theme="dark"><div class="ugc-carousel_ugc-carousel__l_gaM" style="background-color:#bd0b28ff"><div class="ugc-carousel_ugc-carousel__wave__zVZuC"></div><div class="ugc-carousel_ugc-carousel__container__r0E_J"><div class="ugc-carousel_ugc-carousel__content-container__ZR7Ue"><div class="ugc-carousel_ugc-carousel__heading-container__7Q72i"><span class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-d1__yIR1R ugc-carousel_ugc-carousel__heading__eJKTK" aria-hidden="true">cran nation</span><div class="ugc-carousel__stamp"></div></div><div class="ugc-carousel_ugc-carousel__swiper-container____nGO"><!--$--><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--><!--/$--></div><div class="ugc-carousel_ugc-carousel__content-block__algYa"><h2 class="heading_heading__3oBOQ heading_heading-h2__OEMhk ugc-carousel_ugc-carousel__sub-heading__ognko">#allthatpower</h2><p class="text_text__84aqk text-p text_text-body__eEB__ text_text--size--large__gyIqz ugc-carousel_ugc-carousel__body-text__iFIZr">Share your @OceanSprayInc power moments by tagging us and your snaps with #AllThatPower. And don’t be bitter if we don’t pick you right away. Bitter’s our thing.</p></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--></div></main><footer class="footer_footer__46Dbt" id="main-footer"><div class="footer_mask-group__prMrE"><div class="footer_mask-group--texture-1__K2eS_"></div><div class="footer_mask-group--wave-1__Cqfkg"></div><div class="footer_mask-group--texture-2__1wxLm"></div><div class="footer_mask-group--wave-2__b3WXL"></div></div><div class="footer_container__92JSl"><div class="grid_grid__kcw2v grid_grid--type--flexible__Iy2wS footer_grid___Mngc"><div class="logo-container_logo-container__SlOmb"><a href="/" class="logo-container_logo-container__logo-link__4fFeu" aria-label="Go to homepage"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="93" height="51" viewBox="0 0 93 51" fill="none"><title>Ocean Spray®</title><path fill="#00AEEF" d="M29.279 5.097c1.446-3.12 6.323-4.381 8.56-4.654A84.415 84.415 0 0 1 46.5 0c-4.322 0-7.198 1.09-9.081 2.557-2.523 1.142-4.524 2.898-5.281 5.062-.74 2.165-.1 4.67.353 5.694.017.016.034.068.05.119-2.64-1.228-4.994-4.568-3.262-8.335ZM55.934.528C54.438.375 44.112-.545 39.992 3.955c-5.23 5.71-.656 13.619 5.6 14.181-4.743-6.375 6.07-11.659 19.794-9.784 11.789 1.603 23.696 9.017 22.787 19.534-.941 10.91-18.768 19.841-41.606 19.841-24.032 0-42.127-9.8-43.893-21.40