cean Spray® Original Cranberry Juice Cocktail\",\"metaDescription\":\"Get ready for our Ocean Spray® Cranberry Juice Cocktail, a love letter to nutritious juices. This isn't your average fruit juice product—it's a healthy dose of flavor.\",\"metaKeywords\":\"cranberry juice, cranberry juice blends\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Bright Red\",\"countries\":[{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"4YhS9Pyt2s9lYDTnbwU7cg\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-12-06T22:07:30.385Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-10-24T10:00:24.527Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":105,\"revision\":39,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"country\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"name\":\"United States\",\"tld\":\"com\",\"countryCode\":\"US\",\"languages\":[],\"headerMenus\":[],\"footerMenus\":[],\"newsletterHeading\":\"In Cran We Trust\",\"newsletterText\":\"Wave your cran flag high. Join now and get access to exclusive offers, the latest news from the bog, and new product sneak peeks.\",\"newsletterTermsConditionsText\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim\\n\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"legalHeading\":\"©2024 Ocean Spray\",\"destini\":\"oceanspray\",\"mikmak\":\"670032a57a1d7c0f07baae48\",\"bazaarVoice\":\"oceanspray\",\"curalate\":\"oceanspray-g0frjz\",\"bazaarVoiceSiteId\":\"main_site\",\"engineId\":\"j-As7u-eo3_Qc-Xhor-A\",\"gtm\":\"GTM-M7VQVSDN\",\"gtag\":\"G-CSHX9SKFN4\",\"gtmTest\":\"GTM-N8S9WFFH\",\"gtagTest\":\"G-LPKMNCGB2P\"}}],\"gtin\":\"00031200200075\",\"slug\":\"cranberry-juice-cocktail-64-oz\",\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"7eJjV4XFIn6vua5J7prv5y\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-04-11T15:20:29.278Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-11T15:20:29.278Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"64oz OS Cranberry front v2\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7eJjV4XFIn6vua5J7prv5y/6e26af9458c2e0024bc94f40cbb56e96/64oz_OS_Cranberry_front_v2.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":192536,\"image\":{\"width\":500,\"height\":500}},\"fileName\":\"64oz_OS_Cranberry_front_v2.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"description\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Crisp. Experience the insane deliciousness of Ocean Spray® Cranberry Juice Cocktail. The trailblazing juice drink made with bold cranberry fruit juice concentrate. This fruit juice beverage packs 100% of your recommended daily value of vitamin C in a single serving. No high fructose corn syrup. This beverage has only the good stuff. Use this cranberry juice drink as a cocktail mixer for radically refreshing drinks. Serve it over ice with a splash of vodka for a tangy cranberry cocktail. Or change up dinner with some cranberry drunken chicken or cranberry cocktail meatballs. Original Cranberry Juice Cocktail makes a delicious, unique addition to blended beverages and ice pops, too. Get creative. Go bog-wild. All this made possible by the 700+ cranberry family farmers that make up our co-op. Our owners. Our heartbeat. Our inspiration. Ocean Spray believes in the power of the mighty cranberry; Born Tart. Raised Bold.™\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"size\":\"64 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"12cCVmDiPdx071GcPQV4SZ\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-06T18:35:17.627Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-08-18T12:00:36.999Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":12,\"revision\":2,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"64oz OS Cranberry NFP(00002 0000018595)(5328) 1 Ingredients\",\"description\":\"Image for 64oz OS Cranberry NFP(00002 0000018595)(5328) 1 Ingredients\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/12cCVmDiPdx071GcPQV4SZ/e9284b14ea7ce51813ec19c231983432/64oz_OS_Cranberry_Juice_Cocktail_NutFacts.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":538651,\"image\":{\"width\":3000,\"height\":3000}},\"fileName\":\"64oz_OS_Cranberry_Juice_Cocktail_NutFacts.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"nutritionalFacts\":[{\"id\":\"8c9d2b47-61a1-4391-9dfd-c411938122eb\",\"key\":\"No High Fructose Corn Syrup\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"b6f07300-eec9-4069-8bff-dccf0a6a5fa6\",\"key\":\"100% Vitamin C\",\"value\":\"100% Daily Value of Vitamin C per 8 FL OZ serving\"},{\"id\":\"1e7a31b9-c2dd-4cf4-a624-03582dc905bb\",\"key\":\"Consuming one serving (8 oz) each day of a cranberry juice beverage may help reduce the risk of recurrent urinary tract infection (UTI) in healthy women. FDA has concluded that the scientific evidence supporting this claim is limited and inconsistent.\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"disclaimer\":\"100% Vitamin C \\r\\n\\r\\n100% Daily Value of Vitamin C per 8 FL OZ serving  \",\"category\":\"[Circular]\",\"typeFilters\":[],\"benefitFilters\":[],\"hubSpotLabel\":\"The Original Cranberry Juice Cocktail\",\"dietaryFilters\":[],\"flavorFilters\":[],\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"destiniAssociationId\":\"CranberryJuiceCocktail64oz\",\"bvProductId\":\"CFBD1F39-554B-4E79-BB0D-85F7EC5496DD\",\"curalateProductId\":\"CFBD1F39-554B-4E79-BB0D-85F7EC5496DD-64 oz\",\"ogTitle\":\"Ocean Spray® Cranberry Juice Cocktail\",\"upc\":\"CFBD1F39-554B-4E79-BB0D-85F7EC5496DD\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{EB1538BA-F2FE-4476-B0BC-2C0D16D6EA46}\"}}]}},\"backgroundColor\":\"Bright Red\",\"destiniAssociationId\":\"CranTropicalJuiceDrink\",\"bvProductId\":\"A67769B7-1A59-47EE-9DA9-009A3ED057E0\",\"curalateProductId\":\"A67769B7-1A59-47EE-9DA9-009A3ED057E0-64 oz\",\"typeFilters\":[],\"benefitFilters\":[],\"flavorFilters\":[],\"metaTitle\":\"Ocean Spray® Cran x Tropical™: Cranberry, Mango, Guava Juice Drink Blend\",\"metaDescription\":\"Unleash the bold, unique fusion of Ocean Spray's Cran-Tropical Juice. This juice drink delivers a playful blend of cranberry and tropical juices.\\n\",\"metaKeywords\":\"Juices and Drinks, Ocean Spray® Cran∙Tropical™ Juice Drink\",\"ogTitle\":\"\",\"upc\":\"A67769B7-1A59-47EE-9DA9-009A3ED057E0\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{A67769B7-1A59-47EE-9DA9-009A3ED057E0}\",\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"disclaimer\":\"100% Vitamin C \\r\\n\\r\\n100% Daily Value of Vitamin C per 8 FL OZ serving  \"}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"4uZaLNyAYAkl8lUS8kALjs\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-13T13:03:32.606Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-01-16T09:46:45.851Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":252,\"revision\":15,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"product\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"100% Juice Blend Cranberry\",\"slug\":\"100-juice-blend-cranberry-64-oz\",\"hubSpotLabel\":\"100% Juice Blend Cranberry\",\"description\":{\"nodeType\":\"document\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Cult, meet classic with Ocean Spray® 100% Juice Cranberry Juice Blend. AKA the good-for-you renegade that tracks all the way back to the bog. Crisp. Clean. 100% Juice blend for a radically refreshing fruit juice. blend is made with a blend of four 100% real fruit juices. It’s a full punch of flavor without compromise. Use this cranberry juice blend as a cocktail mixer. Add a twist to mocktail drinks. Or keep your beverages simple on the rocks with a splash of tonic. Meet your new favorite addition to any recipe, without any added sugar.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]}]},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"35oheH6ytwlH7PylF11bxS\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:23:25.764Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:23:25.764Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"100% Juice Blend - Cranberry\",\"description\":\"100% Juice Blend - Cranberry front image.\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/35oheH6ytwlH7PylF11bxS/1c45d9871edf00fb13b0439f86eed475/100__Juice_Blend_-_Cranberry.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":420709,\"image\":{\"width\":1000,\"height\":1400}},\"fileName\":\"100% Juice Blend - Cranberry.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"gtin\":\"00031200034694\",\"size\":\"64 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"4P5kfkXHfRAIrqMyxn2EUw\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-10T18:18:12.566Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-09-10T18:18:12.566Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":6,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"64oz 100pct Cranberry NFP(00002 0000017578)(5251) 1 Ingredients\",\"description\":\"Image of nutrition label for 64oz 100pct Cranberry NFP(00002 0000017578)(5251) 1 Ingredients\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4P5kfkXHfRAIrqMyxn2EUw/70a37c0fd02325e9626085f996140e1b/100_Percent_Cranberry_64oz_NutFacts.jpg\",\"details\":{\"size\":173917,\"image\":{\"width\":366,\"height\":866}},\"fileName\":\"100_Percent_Cranberry_64oz_NutFacts.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\"}}},\"nutritionalFacts\":[{\"id\":\"78936241-3182-41ec-9bd9-7e742a951d81\",\"key\":\"100% Vitamin C\",\"value\":\"100% Daily Value of Vitamin C per 8 FL OZ serving.\"},{\"id\":\"7823ca24-b9be-4246-987c-7666d6a9e894\",\"key\":\"**No Sugar Added\",\"value\":\"**Not a low calorie food – see Nutrition Facts for sugar and calorie content\"},{\"id\":\"7730144c-8048-449e-a46c-d6d8298d3f44\",\"key\":\"‡1 CUP OF FRUIT PER SERVING\",\"value\":\"‡Each 8 FL OZ glass is equal to 1 cup of fruit. The USDA MyPlate recommends a daily intake of 2 cups of fruit for a 2,000 calorie diet.\"},{\"id\":\"d1bfb66f-696f-4001-9593-ac259d23700a\",\"key\":\"Contains 100% Juice\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"41480e5f-bcf3-4e92-9ebb-468fc3fc0159\",\"key\":\"Now WIC-approved in select states.\",\"value\":\"The list of WIC-approved states and products is subject to change. Please check with your state’s WIC agency to confirm which WIC Ocean Spray® products are currently approved.\"}],\"countries\":[{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"4YhS9Pyt2s9lYDTnbwU7cg\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-12-06T22:07:30.385Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-10-24T10:00:24.527Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":105,\"revision\":39,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"country\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"name\":\"United States\",\"tld\":\"com\",\"countryCode\":