smod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim\\n\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"legalHeading\":\"©2024 Ocean Spray\",\"destini\":\"oceanspray\",\"mikmak\":\"670032a57a1d7c0f07baae48\",\"bazaarVoice\":\"oceanspray\",\"curalate\":\"oceanspray-g0frjz\",\"bazaarVoiceSiteId\":\"main_site\",\"engineId\":\"j-As7u-eo3_Qc-Xhor-A\",\"gtm\":\"GTM-M7VQVSDN\",\"gtag\":\"G-CSHX9SKFN4\",\"gtmTest\":\"GTM-N8S9WFFH\",\"gtagTest\":\"G-LPKMNCGB2P\"}}],\"category\":\"[Circular]\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Bright Red\",\"destiniAssociationId\":\"strawberry_marg_mixer\",\"bvProductId\":\"6DCE872E-728E-454C-BD45-DC201ABE4275\",\"curalateProductId\":\"6DCE872E-728E-454C-BD45-DC201ABE4275-32 oz\",\"typeFilters\":[],\"benefitFilters\":[],\"dietaryFilters\":[],\"flavorFilters\":[],\"metaTitle\":\"Ocean Spray® Strawberry Margarita Cocktail Mixer\",\"metaDescription\":\"Unleash your wild side with Ocean Spray's Strawberry Margarita Cocktail Mixer. Surrender to the swirl of this uniquely delicious strawberry mix.\",\"metaKeywords\":\"Juices and Drinks, Strawberry Margarita Cocktail Mixer\",\"ogTitle\":\"\",\"upc\":\"6DCE872E-728E-454C-BD45-DC201ABE4275\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{6DCE872E-728E-454C-BD45-DC201ABE4275}\",\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"disclaimer\":\"Made with real fruit juice\\r\\n\\r\\nLess sugar than the leading mixer\\r\\n\\r\\n This product (12g sugar per 3 FL OZ) has 35% less sugar than the leading brand cocktail mixer (19g sugar per 3 FL OZ). \"}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"5SEoOE72F51m9AMKEcptNn\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-13T13:23:59.559Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-01-16T09:45:20.429Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":67,\"revision\":16,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"product\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Rum Punch Cocktail Mixer\",\"slug\":\"rum-punch-cocktail-mixer-32-oz\",\"hubSpotLabel\":\"Rum Punch Cocktail Mixer\",\"description\":{\"nodeType\":\"document\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"A perfectly balanced mix of tropical flavors ready in seconds. Just add rum to Ocean Spray® Rum Punch Cocktail Mixer for a restaurant quality drink at home. Made from real fruit juice and less sugar than the leading mixer, this rum punch mix offers balanced fruity flavor for beverages with tropical vacation taste and at-home ease. Make a splash and impress guests with this rum punch drink mixer; perfect for creating effortlessly excellent cocktails for big and small gatherings and special events. Whether you're stirring in your favorite rum or trying something new, this drink mix makes a bold, refreshing beverage every time. Ocean Spray® also offers other delicious drink mixers for your favorite cocktails in seconds. We believe in uncommonly bold mashups.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]}]},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"2VAbroB2oMmh7aEJ2Wgef0\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:29:17.509Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:29:17.509Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Rum Punch Cocktail Mixer\",\"description\":\"Rum Punch Cocktail Mixer front image.\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/2VAbroB2oMmh7aEJ2Wgef0/205f263c41dc06b9ce3e598a23ef7673/Rum_Punch_Cocktail_Mixer.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":366096,\"image\":{\"width\":1000,\"height\":1400}},\"fileName\":\"Rum Punch Cocktail Mixer.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"gtin\":\"00031200022677\",\"size\":\"32 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"CYjT4PokmqNDoJU0NGjt2\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-10T18:28:23.128Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-09-10T18:28:23.128Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":5,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"32oz OS Rum Punch Mixer NFP(00002 0000016719)(5154) 1 Ingredients\",\"description\":\"Image for 32oz OS Rum Punch Mixer NFP(00002 0000016719)(5154) 1 Ingredients\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/CYjT4PokmqNDoJU0NGjt2/da8adf483e1d561d2d3beff696d4a657/Rum_Punch_Cocktail_Mixer_NutFacts.jpg\",\"details\":{\"size\":163198,\"image\":{\"width\":366,\"height\":803}},\"fileName\":\"Rum_Punch_Cocktail_Mixer_NutFacts.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\"}}},\"nutritionalFacts\":[{\"id\":\"e6e56704-3750-47e3-8442-2016bceae27e\",\"key\":\"Made with Real Fruit Juice\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"ad270f0c-2992-4212-990c-dfd2c89f5e18\",\"key\":\"Less sugar than the leading mixer\",\"value\":\"This product (11g sugar per 3 FL OZ) has 40% less sugar than the leading brand cocktail mixer (19g sugar per 3 FL OZ).\"}],\"countries\":[{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"4YhS9Pyt2s9lYDTnbwU7cg\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-12-06T22:07:30.385Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-10-24T10:00:24.527Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":105,\"revision\":39,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"country\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US