fe's fun moments with Ocean Spray® Rum Punch Cocktail Mixer. Perfect for the mixer lovers, this non-alcoholic mixer offers the distinct flavor of Ocean Spray® fruit.\",\"metaKeywords\":\"Juices and Drinks, Rum Punch Cocktail Mixer\",\"ogTitle\":\"\",\"upc\":\"27ABD192-E93B-4275-98A0-92366D64B375\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{27ABD192-E93B-4275-98A0-92366D64B375}\",\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"disclaimer\":\"Made with real fruit juice\\r\\n\\r\\nLess sugar than the leading mixer\\r\\n\\r\\n This product (11g sugar per 3 FL OZ) has 40% less sugar than the leading brand cocktail mixer (19g sugar per 3 FL OZ). \"}}]}},\"backgroundColor\":\"Bright Red\",\"destiniAssociationId\":\"cosmo_cocktail_mixer\",\"bvProductId\":\"768B3D63-305F-45CD-9A39-14DA4C76BF3B\",\"curalateProductId\":\"768B3D63-305F-45CD-9A39-14DA4C76BF3B-32 oz\",\"typeFilters\":[],\"benefitFilters\":[],\"dietaryFilters\":[],\"flavorFilters\":[],\"metaTitle\":\"Ocean Spray® Cosmopolitan Cocktail Mixer - Easy Mixing Ingredients\",\"metaDescription\":\"Unleash the mixologist in you with Ocean Spray's premium Cosmopolitan cocktail mixer. Easy cocktail mixing becomes your new forte with this top-notch juice drink.\",\"metaKeywords\":\"Juices and Drinks, Cosmopolitan Cocktail Mixer\",\"ogTitle\":\"\",\"upc\":\"768B3D63-305F-45CD-9A39-14DA4C76BF3B\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{768B3D63-305F-45CD-9A39-14DA4C76BF3B}\",\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"disclaimer\":\"Made with real fruit juice\\r\\n\\r\\nLess sugar than the leading mixer\\r\\n\\r\\n This product (12g sugar per 3 FL OZ) has 35% less sugar than the leading brand cocktail mixer (19g sugar per 3 FL OZ). \"}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"5pwxAecvh63oXJVa8lmtRn\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-13T13:27:29.446Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-01-16T09:54:42.638Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":55,\"revision\":14,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"product\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Sparkling Cranberry\",\"slug\":\"sparkling-cranberry-4-11-5-oz\",\"hubSpotLabel\":\"Sparkling Cranberry\",\"description\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Crisp. Clean. Fizzy. Try Ocean Spray® Sparkling Cranberry Juice Drink. A one-two punch of refreshment from real cranberry fruit juice and fizzy water. This sparkling juice brings the flavor without compromise. With no high fructose corn syrup and just half the sugar of the leading soft drink(1), it's a beverage you can feel good about. Use this sparkling cranberry juice drink as a cocktail mixer in your favorite beverages. Bring a chilled can with you to stay refreshed on the go. Sparkling Cranberry Juice Drink is the perfect anytime beverage. All this made possible by the 700+ cranberry farming families that make up our co-op. Our owners. Our heartbeat. Our inspiration. Ocean Spray believes in the power of the mighty cranberry; Born Tart. Raised Bold.™ (1) This product contains 17g sugar per 11.5 fl oz serving compared to 37g sugar in 11.5 fl oz serving of the leading soft drink.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"2oQJ4iB32llElk4juXhz30\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:24:25.083Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:24:25.083Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Sparkling Cranberry\",\"description\":\"Sparkling Cranberry front image.\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk