into the vibrant world of Ocean Spray® Navel Oranges. This citrus fruit delight is part of our fresh produce collection, offering a taste that's true to nature.\",\"metaKeywords\":\"Fresh Navel Oranges\",\"ogTitle\":\"\",\"upc\":\"1FAD35EF-8105-41A8-9606-6E910081FFDD\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{1FAD35EF-8105-41A8-9606-6E910081FFDD}\",\"associatedRecipes\":[]}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"4h40wFSF1kc7QoeDeQKFrw\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-13T13:26:36.726Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-01-16T09:57:23.073Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":62,\"revision\":15,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"product\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Grapes\",\"slug\":\"grapes-2-lb-red\",\"hubSpotLabel\":\"Grapes\",\"description\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Whether round or oval, red, green, or black, a platter of freshly rinsed grapes offers the perfect opportunity to pluck, pop, and savor. They bring luscious color to charcuterie boards and are the perfect complement to sharp cheeses with their crisp texture and palate-cleansing, sweet taste.\\r\\nOcean Spray® fresh grapes are passionately grown and hand-picked to come straight from the farm to your family.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"63WIovt4RuU8m4gJzkn8VH\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:20:59.751Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:20:59.751Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkTyp