berry juice, cranberry juice blends\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Bright Red\",\"countries\":[{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"4YhS9Pyt2s9lYDTnbwU7cg\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-12-06T22:07:30.385Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-10-24T10:00:24.527Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":105,\"revision\":39,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"country\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"name\":\"United States\",\"tld\":\"com\",\"countryCode\":\"US\",\"languages\":[],\"headerMenus\":[],\"footerMenus\":[],\"newsletterHeading\":\"In Cran We Trust\",\"newsletterText\":\"Wave your cran flag high. Join now and get access to exclusive offers, the latest news from the bog, and new product sneak peeks.\",\"newsletterTermsConditionsText\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim\\n\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"legalHeading\":\"©2024 Ocean Spray\",\"destini\":\"oceanspray\",\"mikmak\":\"670032a57a1d7c0f07baae48\",\"bazaarVoice\":\"oceanspray\",\"curalate\":\"oceanspray-g0frjz\",\"bazaarVoiceSiteId\":\"main_site\",\"engineId\":\"j-As7u-eo3_Qc-Xhor-A\",\"gtm\":\"GTM-M7VQVSDN\",\"gtag\":\"G-CSHX9SKFN4\",\"gtmTest\":\"GTM-N8S9WFFH\",\"gtagTest\":\"G-LPKMNCGB2P\"}}],\"gtin\":\"00031200200075\",\"slug\":\"cranberry-juice-cocktail-64-oz\",\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"7eJjV4XFIn6vua5J7prv5y\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-04-11T15:20:29.278Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-11T15:20:29.278Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"64oz OS Cranberry front v2\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7eJjV4XFIn6vua5J7prv5y/6e26af9458c2e0024bc94f40cbb56e96/64oz_OS_Cranberry_front_v2.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":192536,\"image\":{\"width\":500,\"height\":500}},\"fileName\":\"64oz_OS_Cranberry_front_v2.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"description\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Crisp. Experience the insane deliciousness of Ocean Spray® Cranberry Juice Cocktail. The trailblazing juice drink made with bold cranberry fruit juice concentrate. This fruit juice beverage packs 100% of your recommended daily value of vitamin C in a single serving. No high fructose corn syrup. This beverage has only the good stuff. Use this cranberry juice drink as a cocktail mixer for radically refreshing drinks. Serve it over ice with a splash of vodka for a tangy cranberry cocktail. Or change up dinner with some cranberry drunken chicken or cranberry cocktail meatballs. Original Cranberry Juice Cocktail makes a delicious, unique addition to blended beverages and ice pops, too. Get creative. Go bog-wild. All this made possible by the 700+ cranberry family farmers that make up our co-op. Our owners. Our heartbeat. Our inspiration. Ocean Spray believes in the power of the mighty cranberry; Born Tart. Raised Bold.™\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"size\":\"64 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"12cCVmDiPdx071GcPQV4SZ\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-06T18:35:17.627Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-08-18T12:00:36.999Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":12,\"revision\":2,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"64oz OS Cranberry NFP(00002 0000018595)(5328) 1 Ingredients\",\"description\":\"Image for 64oz OS Cranberry NFP(00002 0000018595)(5328) 1 Ingredients\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/12cCVmDiPdx071GcPQV4SZ/e9284b14ea7ce51813ec19c231983432/64oz_OS_Cranberry_Juice_Cocktail_NutFacts.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":538651,\"image\":{\"width\":3000,\"height\":3000}},\"fileName\":\"64oz_OS_Cranberry_Juice_Cocktail_NutFacts.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"nutritionalFacts\":[{\"id\":\"8c9d2b47-61a1-4391-9dfd-c411938122eb\",\"key\":\"No High Fructose Corn Syrup\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"b6f07300-eec9-4069-8bff-dccf0a6a5fa6\",\"key\":\"100% Vitamin C\",\"value\":\"100% Daily Value of Vitamin C per 8 FL OZ serving\"},{\"id\":\"1e7a31b9-c2dd-4cf4-a624-03582dc905bb\",\"key\":\"Consuming one serving (8 oz) each day of a cranberry juice beverage may help reduce the risk of recurrent urinary tract infection (UTI) in healthy women. FDA has concluded that the scientific evidence supporting this claim is limited and inconsistent.\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"disclaimer\":\"100% Vitamin C \\r\\n\\r\\n100% Daily Value of Vitamin C per 8 FL OZ serving  \",\"category\":\"[Circular]\",\"typeFilters\":[],\"benefitFilters\":[],\"hubSpotLabel\":\"The Original Cranberry Juice Cocktail\",\"dietaryFilters\":[],\"flavorFilters\":[],\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"destiniAssociationId\":\"CranberryJuiceCocktail64oz\",\"bvProductId\":\"CFBD1F39-554B-4E79-BB0D-85F7EC5496DD\",\"curalateProductId\":\"CFBD1F39-554B-4E79-BB0D-85F7EC5496DD-64 oz\",\"ogTitle\":\"Ocean Spray® Cranberry Juice Cocktail\",\"upc\":\"CFBD1F39-554B-4E79-BB0D-85F7EC5496DD\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{EB1538BA-F2FE-4476-B0BC-2C0D16D6EA46}\"}}]}},\"backgroundColor\":\"Bright Red\",\"destiniAssociationId\":\"100JuiceCranberry60oz\",\"bvProductId\":\"4AF61B79-85E1-471F-8EBD-91BF5FAA21B8\",\"curalateProductId\":\"4AF61B79-85E1-471F-8EBD-91BF5FAA21B8-64 oz\",\"typeFilters\":[],\"benefitFilters\":[],\"flavorFilters\":[],\"metaTitle\":\"Ocean Spray® Cranberry Juice - 100% Juice Blend\",\"metaDescription\":\"Savor the unexpected delight of Ocean Spray's 100% Juice Blend with a punch of Cranberry Juice. Unapologetically healthy, uniquely delicious.\",\"metaKeywords\":\"Juices and Drinks, 100 Percent Juice Blend Cranberry\",\"ogTitle\":\"\",\"upc\":\"4AF61B79-85E1-471F-8EBD-91BF5FAA21B8\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{D3EC05C5-E6D8-4965-A041-80C8E0EF1021}\",\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"disclaimer\":\"1 CUP OF FRUIT‡\\r\\n‡Each 8 FL OZ glass is equal to 1 cup of fruit. The USDA MyPlate recommends a daily intake of 2 cups of fruit for a 2,000 calorie diet. \\r\\n\\r\\nNO SUGAR ADDED**\\r\\n**Not a low calorie food – see Nutrition Facts for sugar and calorie content\\r\\n\\r\\n 100% VITAMIN C\\r\\n100% Daily Value of Vitamin C per 8 FL OZ serving.\"}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"6QOBbARTnHlwNv5lSAc3GU\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-13T13:08:02.062Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-01-16T09:54:42.332Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":240,\"revision\":19,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"product\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"White Cran x Strawberry™\",\"slug\":\"white-cran-strawberry-white-cranberry-and-strawberry-juice-drink-64-oz\",\"hubSpotLabel\":\"White Cran x Strawberry™\",\"description\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Sweeten the moment with Ocean Spray® White Cran-Strawberry Juice Drink. Light and refreshing meets crisp and bold with this blend of white cranberry and strawberry juices. This fruit juice beverage packs 100% of your recommended daily value of vitamin C in a single serving. Enjoy the sweet, tasty flavor of white cranberry juice and strawberry juice concentrate. Did we mention Ocean Spray® White Cran-Strawberry Juice Drink is made with no high fructose corn syrup? It's truly a win-win. Use this cranberry juice drink as a cocktail mixer for elevated drinks, or serve it cold on its own. White Cranberry makes a delicious, unique addition to blended beverages and ice pops, too. Go ahead and get creative. This juice drink won't let you down. All this made possible by the 700+ cranberry farming families that make up our co-op. Our owners. Our heartbeat. Our inspiration. Ocean Spray believes in the power of the mighty cranberry; Born Tart. Raised Bold.™\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"2C8DRJYCo7AVI7RxbN1qcf\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-04-10T21:53:27.221Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-10T21:53:27.221Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"64oz OS White Cran Strawberry front v2\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/2C8DRJYCo7AVI7RxbN1qcf/aed004654980b791a331254c99e44450/64oz_OS_White_Cran_Strawberry_front_v2.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":184684,\"image\":{\"width\":500,\"height\":500}},\"fileName\":\"64oz_OS_White_Cran_Strawberry_front_v2.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"gtin\":\"00031200281302\",\"size\":\"64 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"2kT826XcDwXXvaiWU3kL09\",\"type\":\"As