"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"4YhS9Pyt2s9lYDTnbwU7cg\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-12-06T22:07:30.385Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-10-24T10:00:24.527Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":105,\"revision\":39,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"country\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"name\":\"United States\",\"tld\":\"com\",\"countryCode\":\"US\",\"languages\":[],\"headerMenus\":[],\"footerMenus\":[],\"newsletterHeading\":\"In Cran We Trust\",\"newsletterText\":\"Wave your cran flag high. Join now and get access to exclusive offers, the latest news from the bog, and new product sneak peeks.\",\"newsletterTermsConditionsText\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim\\n\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"legalHeading\":\"©2024 Ocean Spray\",\"destini\":\"oceanspray\",\"mikmak\":\"670032a57a1d7c0f07baae48\",\"bazaarVoice\":\"oceanspray\",\"curalate\":\"oceanspray-g0frjz\",\"bazaarVoiceSiteId\":\"main_site\",\"engineId\":\"j-As7u-eo3_Qc-Xhor-A\",\"gtm\":\"GTM-M7VQVSDN\",\"gtag\":\"G-CSHX9SKFN4\",\"gtmTest\":\"GTM-N8S9WFFH\",\"gtagTest\":\"G-LPKMNCGB2P\"}}],\"gtin\":\"00031200200075\",\"slug\":\"cranberry-juice-cocktail-64-oz\",\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"7eJjV4XFIn6vua5J7prv5y\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-04-11T15:20:29.278Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-11T15:20:29.278Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"64oz OS Cranberry front v2\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/7eJjV4XFIn6vua5J7prv5y/6e26af9458c2e0024bc94f40cbb56e96/64oz_OS_Cranberry_front_v2.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":192536,\"image\":{\"width\":500,\"height\":500}},\"fileName\":\"64oz_OS_Cranberry_front_v2.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"description\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Crisp. Experience the insane deliciousness of Ocean Spray® Cranberry Juice Cocktail. The trailblazing juice drink made with bold cranberry fruit juice concentrate. This fruit juice beverage packs 100% of your recommended daily value of vitamin C in a single serving. No high fructose corn syrup. This beverage has only the good stuff. Use this cranberry juice drink as a cocktail mixer for radically refreshing drinks. Serve it over ice with a splash of vodka for a tangy cranberry cocktail. Or change up dinner with some cranberry drunken chicken or cranberry cocktail meatballs. Original Cranberry Juice Cocktail makes a delicious, unique addition to blended beverages and ice pops, too. Get creative. Go bog-wild. All this made possible by the 700+ cranberry family farmers that make up our co-op. Our owners. Our heartbeat. Our inspiration. Ocean Spray believes in the power of the mighty cranberry; Born Tart. Raised Bold.™\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"size\":\"64 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"12cCVmDiPdx071GcPQV4SZ\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-06T18:35:17.627Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-08-18T12:00:36.999Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":12,\"revision\":2,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"64oz OS Cranberry NFP(00002 0000018595)(5328) 1 Ingredients\",\"description\":\"Image for 64oz OS Cranberry NFP(00002 0000018595)(5328) 1 Ingredients\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/12cCVmDiPdx071GcPQV4SZ/e9284b14ea7ce51813ec19c231983432/64oz_OS_Cranberry_Juice_Cocktail_NutFacts.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":538651,\"image\":{\"width\":3000,\"height\":3000}},\"fileName\":\"64oz_OS_Cranberry_Juice_Cocktail_NutFacts.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"nutritionalFacts\":[{\"id\":\"8c9d2b47-61a1-4391-9dfd-c411938122eb\",\"key\":\"No High Fructose Corn Syrup\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"b6f07300-eec9-4069-8bff-dccf0a6a5fa6\",\"key\":\"100% Vitamin C\",\"value\":\"100% Daily Value of Vitamin C per 8 FL OZ serving\"},{\"id\":\"1e7a31b9-c2dd-4cf4-a624-03582dc905bb\",\"key\":\"Consuming one serving (8 oz) each day of a cranberry juice beverage may help reduce the risk of recurrent urinary tract infection (UTI) in healthy women. FDA has concluded that the scientific evidence supporting this claim is limited and inconsistent.\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"disclaimer\":\"100% Vitamin C \\r\\n\\r\\n100% Daily Value of Vitamin C per 8 FL OZ serving  \",\"category\":\"[Circular]\",\"typeFilters\":[],\"benefitFilters\":[],\"hubSpotLabel\":\"The Original Cranberry Juice Cocktail\",\"dietaryFilters\":[],\"flavorFilters\":[],\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"destiniAssociationId\":\"CranberryJuiceCocktail64oz\",\"bvProductId\":\"CFBD1F39-554B-4E79-BB0D-85F7EC5496DD\",\"curalateProductId\":\"CFBD1F39-554B-4E79-BB0D-85F7EC5496DD-64 oz\",\"ogTitle\":\"Ocean Spray® Cranberry Juice Cocktail\",\"upc\":\"CFBD1F39-554B-4E79-BB0D-85F7EC5496DD\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{EB1538BA-F2FE-4476-B0BC-2C0D16D6EA46}\"}}]}},\"backgroundColor\":\"Bright Red\",\"destiniAssociationId\":\"SparklingCranberry684oz\",\"bvProductId\":\"4192CADE-6A48-4A12-8F4D-831BF3640E11\",\"curalateProductId\":\"4192CADE-6A48-4A12-8F4D-831BF3640E11-4/11.5 oz\",\"typeFilters\":[],\"benefitFilters\":[],\"flavorFilters\":[],\"metaTitle\":\"Ocean Spray® Sparkling Cranberry Juice: Cranberry Fruit Drink\",\"metaDescription\":\"Kick up your feet with Ocean Spray's Sparkling Cranberry Drink. More than just cranberry juice, it's a zestful beverage that dances the rumba on your tongue.\",\"metaKeywords\":\"Juices and Drinks, Sparkling Cranberry\",\"ogTitle\":\"\",\"upc\":\"4192CADE-6A48-4A12-8F4D-831BF3640E11\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{4DEAF7CC-6C6B-48D9-B509-0164DD14DB4C}\",\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"disclaimer\":\"Made with Real Fruit Juice\\r\\nNo High Fructose Corn Syrup\\r\\nExcellent Source of Vitamin C\"}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"2lIK2MpjdFSOCFsWsJqFpO\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-13T13:24:06.513Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-01-16T09:44:19.480Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":59,\"revision\":15,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"product\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Strawberry Margarita Cocktail Mixer\",\"slug\":\"strawberry-margarita-cocktail-mixer-32-oz\",\"hubSpotLabel\":\"Strawberry Margarita Cocktail Mixer\",\"description\":{\"nodeType\":\"document\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"A perfectly balanced mix of strawberry and lime flavors ready in seconds. Just add tequila to Ocean Spray® Strawberry Margarita Cocktail Mixer for a restaurant quality margarita at home. Made from real strawberry and lime fruit juice and less sugar than the leading mixer, this strawberry margarita mix strikes the right balance between sweet and tangy for beverages with vacation taste and at-home ease. Make a splash and impress guests with this margarita drink mixer; perfect for creating effortlessly excellent cocktails for big and small gatherings and special events. Whether you're stirring in your favorite tequila or trying something new, this margarita mixer makes a bold, refreshing beverage every time. Ocean Spray® also offers other delicious drink mixers for your favorite cocktails in seconds. We believe in uncommonly bold mashups.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]}]},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"2xBtkCbX9QLiLhM8InfsgQ\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:19:34.484Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:19:34.484Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Strawberry Margarita Cocktail Mixer\",\"description\":\"Strawberry Margarita Cocktail Mixer front image.\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/2xBtkCbX9QLiLhM8InfsgQ/c6583f70a7d85a60592ea94f7a13fc6e/Strawberry_Margarita_Cocktail_Mixer.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":378876,\"image\":{\"width\":1000,\"height\":1400}},\"fileName\":\"Strawberry Margarita Cocktail Mixer.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"gtin\":\"00031200022684\",\"size\":\"32 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"67WgRB1lEGvMwegRlRwWuS\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-10T18:28:03.048Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-09-10T18:28:03.048Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":5,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"32oz OS Strawberry Margarita Mixer NFP(00002 0000016711)(5153) 1 Ingredients\",\"description\":\"Image for 32oz OS Strawberry Margarita Mixer NFP(00002 0000016711)(5153) 1\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/67WgRB1lEGvMwegRlRwWuS/2c0a3ef309cc9abaeef84d81d42f9ce8/Strawberry_Margarita_Cock