ers the perfect opportunity to pluck, pop, and savor. They bring luscious color to charcuterie boards and are the perfect complement to sharp cheeses with their crisp texture and palate-cleansing, sweet taste.\\r\\nOcean Spray® fresh grapes are passionately grown and hand-picked to come straight from the farm to your family.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"63WIovt4RuU8m4gJzkn8VH\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:20:59.751Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:20:59.751Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Grapes\",\"description\":\"Grapes front image.\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/63WIovt4RuU8m4gJzkn8VH/2368bc5e88760e91457931ac60192232/Grapes.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":415269,\"image\":{\"width\":1000,\"height\":816}},\"fileName\":\"Grapes.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"gtin\":\"00066022003405\",\"size\":\"2 lb - Red\",\"nutritionalFacts\":[],\"countries\":[{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"4YhS9Pyt2s9lYDTnbwU7cg\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-12-06T22:07:30.385Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-10-24T10:00:24.527Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":105,\"revision\":39,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"country\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"name\":\"United States\",\"tld\":\"com\",\"countryCode\":\"US\",\"languages\":[],\"headerMenus\":[],\"footerMenus\":[],\"newslett