 be underestimated, seedless navel oranges present an aromatic experience when peeled on their own and can be juiced, cut in wedges for sharing, or sliced in rounds and sprinkled with cinnamon for an exotic snack.\\r\\nOcean Spray® fresh oranges are passionately grown and hand-picked to come straight from the farm to your family.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"22lut6OKlNJzmfJ0NvUO1Z\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:26:08.820Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:26:08.820Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Navel Oranges\",\"description\":\"Navel Oranges front image.\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/22lut6OKlNJzmfJ0NvUO1Z/072b7283265766618314f652556dcfdf/Navel_Oranges.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":567581,\"image\":{\"width\":1000,\"height\":1400}},\"fileName\":\"Navel Oranges.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"gtin\":\"00066022002729\",\"size\":\"3 lb\",\"nutritionalFacts\":[],\"countries\":[{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"4YhS9Pyt2s9lYDTnbwU7cg\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-12-06T22:07:30.385Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-10-24T10:00:24.527Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":105,\"revision\":39,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"country\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"name\":\"United States\",\"tld\":\"com\",\"countryCode\":\"US\",\"languages\":[],\"headerMenus\":[],\