aster\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":10,\"revision\":4,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"spacer\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"internalName\":\"Off-White default Spacer\",\"variant\":\"Spacer\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Off White\"}}],\"featuredProducts\":[{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"5HEAO0yM3JaToQiqvTriaV\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-13T13:24:11.656Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-19T21:19:23.750Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":113,\"revision\":17,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"product\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Craisins® Original Dried Cranberries\",\"slug\":\"craisins-original-dried-cranberries-4-5-oz\",\"hubSpotLabel\":\"Craisins® Original Dried Cranberries\",\"description\":{\"nodeType\":\"document\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"The original. The legend. Ocean Spray® Craisins® Original Dried Cranberries. Mouth-watering flavor with uncanny nutrition. This cranberry dried fruit product is an easy way to work in 25% of your daily recommended fruit needs. No artificial flavors or preservatives. Enjoy real, bold dried cranberries in every dried fruit pouch. Potent little puckers that are peanut-free, gluten-free and judgment-free. Top your weeknight salads. Mix them in your oatmeal or cereal. Use as baking ingredients in your favorite treats, like chewy dried cranberry oatmeal chocolate chunk cookies. Step up your entertaining game by adding their powerful flavor and color to apps, charcuterie boards and more. Transform boring lunches and dinners into mic-dropping meals - from chicken salad and gourmet grilled cheeses to Crockpot curry, beef stew and even Taco Tuesdays. It's true. They're surprisingly delicious on tacos and in guacamole. Can raisins do all that? Nope. They're also just really good on their own.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]}]},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"5qPcxZul51oTvM1IgmN8B3\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-11-04T06:40:49.101Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-11-04T06:40:49.101Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":6,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"4p5oz Craisins Original front\",\"description\":\"\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/5qPcxZul51oTvM1IgmN8B3/b88b7805c38d231dd91aad9f115b4d66/4p5oz_Craisins_Original_front-_1_.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":4248091,\"image\":{\"width\":1854,\"height\":2544}},\"fileName\":\"4p5oz_Craisins_Original_front-(1).png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"gtin\":\"00031200001597\",\"size\":\"4.5 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"4rYjcinDkzjtsrc8O5uBIh\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-10T18:33:02.251Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-09-10T18:33:02.251Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":5,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"48oz OS Craisins Original NFP(00002 0000006260) 1 Ingredients\",\"description\":\"Image for 48oz OS Craisins Original NFP(00002 0000006260) 1\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/4rYjcinDkzjtsrc8O5uBIh/9d4b70b74e37e73cb7f18aa7aae42103/6oz_OS_Craisins_Original_NFP.jpg\",\"details\":{\"size\":221791,\"image\":{\"width\":366,\"height\"