to exclusive offers, the latest news from the bog, and new product sneak peeks.\",\"newsletterTermsConditionsText\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim\\n\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"legalHeading\":\"©2024 Ocean Spray\",\"destini\":\"oceanspray\",\"bazaarVoice\":\"oceanspray\",\"curalate\":\"oceanspray-g0frjz\",\"bazaarVoiceSiteId\":\"main_site\",\"engineId\":\"j-As7u-eo3_Qc-Xhor-A\",\"gtm\":\"GTM-M7VQVSDN\",\"gtag\":\"G-CSHX9SKFN4\",\"gtmTest\":\"GTM-N8S9WFFH\",\"gtagTest\":\"G-LPKMNCGB2P\"}}],\"gtin\":\"00031200001689\",\"slug\":\"craisins-50-less-sugar-dried-cranberries-5-oz\",\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"2dxNBaxiytQb9U82Y2hrkW\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:26:30.520Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:26:30.520Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Craisins® 50% Less Sugar Dried Cranberries\",\"description\":\"Craisins® 50% Less Sugar Dried Cranberries front image.\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/2dxNBaxiytQb9U82Y2hrkW/357476509855f6033166e3f42acdc561/Craisins__50__Less_Sugar_Dried_Cranberries.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":1678162,\"image\":{\"width\":1000,\"height\":1400}},\"fileName\":\"Craisins® 50% Less Sugar Dried Cranberries.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"description\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Mouth-watering flavor. 50% less sugar than Original Craisins® Dried Cranberries. Enjoy real, bold dried cranberries in every dried fruit pouch. Potent little puckers that are peanut-free, gluten-free and judgment-free. Top your weeknight salads. Mix them in your oatmeal or cereal. Use as baking ingredients in your favorite treats, like chewy dried cranberry oatmeal chocolate chunk cookies. Step up your entertaining game by adding their powerful flavor and color to apps, charcuterie boards and more.  They're also just really good on their own.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"size\":\"5 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"1cYBxOopSbzrKRJEzm7czF\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-12-04T17:13:22.907Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-04T17:13:22.907Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"5oz OS Craisins Less Sugar Nutrition Facts Panel\",\"description\":\"5oz OS Craisins Less Sugar Nutrition Facts Panel\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/1cYBxOopSbzrKRJEzm7czF/a2fe65ff1acc3091b1e745051c99203b/5oz_OS_Craisins_Less_Sugar_CMB_7641__1.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":202001,\"image\":{\"width\":3000,\"height\":3000}},\"fileName\":\"5oz_OS_Craisins_Less_Sugar_CMB(7641)_1.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"nutritionalFacts\":[{\"id\":\"eae4968b-836e-4cbd-8b9a-36611c514f4f\",\"key\":\"No Artificial Flavors or Preservatives\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"260b6716-ca24-4716-9541-4cefc7b5c0d5\",\"key\":\"50% Less Sugar\",\"value\":\"Than Original Craisins® Dried Cranberries.**\"},{\"id\":\"b5e81a54-0b4c-4686-8cf8-144e3398e2e3\",\"key\":\"Excellent Source of Fiber\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"3b9daacc-845c-4e62-9085-07e2e445357a\",\"key\":\"Peanut Free\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"5e055d5a-a968-4cc3-9b4a-afa9c92b5624\",\"key\":\"Gluten Free\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"329fe6a2-d6ba-4693-bb34-6f2df2facd61\",\"key\":\"Made from Real Fruit\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"5b2fe7d8-2aa3-4d0e-93c0-38f759d212ed\",\"key\":\"Multi serve: 50% Less Sugar**\",\"value\":\"**This product contains 14 g sugar compared to 29 g sugar per serving of Craisins® Original Dried Cranberries\"}],\"disclaimer\":\"No artificial colors, flavors or preservatives, 50% Less Sugar**\\n**Compared to Original Craisins® Dried Cranberries, Excellent Source of Fiber , Peanut Free , Gluten Free, Made from real fruit\",\"category\":\"[Circular]\",\"typeFilters\":[],\"benefitFilters\":[],\"hubSpotLabel\":\"Craisins® 50% Less Sugar Dried Cranberries\",\"dietaryFilters\":[],\"flavorFilters\":[],\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"destiniAssociationId\":\"ReducedSugarCraisinsDriedCranberries\",\"bvProductId\":\"DEB6ADA1-A04A-457C-9B91-13A553C7422B\",\"curalateProductId\":\"DEB6ADA1-A04A-457C-9B91-13A553C7422B-5 oz\",\"ogTitle\":\"\",\"upc\":\"DEB6ADA1-A04A-457C-9B91-13A553C7422B\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{B489E657-E993-4DFE-AC61-C1FD7956C2E4}\"}},\"[Circular]\",{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"2y2MMtBIg80LhoqTcYr29A\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-13T13:24:23.766Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-05-07T14:44:48.546Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":107,\"revision\":16,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"product\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Craisins® Dried Cranberries Cherry Juice Infused\",\"slug\":\"craisins-dried-cranberries-cherry-juice-infused-6-oz\",\"hubSpotLabel\":\"Craisins® Dried Cranberries Cherry Juice Infused\",\"description\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Big, bold, and bursting with cherry goodness. Ocean Spray® Cherry Flavored Craisins® Dried Cranberries combine the tart punch of dried cranberries with juicy cherry flavor for a snack that’s sweet, tangy, and totally crave-worthy. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Plus, 1 serving of Craisins® Dried Cranberries Cherry Juice Infused meets 25% of your daily recommended fruit needs. †Each ¼ cup serving Craisins® Dried Cranberries provides ½ cup of fruit.  The USDA My Plate recommends a daily intake of 2 cups of fruit for a 2,000 calorie diet. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"9z7BGChoW0OXnHwQBSFTk\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:21:25.730Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-05-07T14:44:33.583Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":6,\"revision\":2,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Craisins® Dried Cranberries Cherry Juice Infused\",\"description\":\"Craisins® Dried Cranberries Cherry Juice Infused front image.\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/9z7BGChoW0OXnHwQBSFTk/92c4bc35a50ef77639020f40c626f34f/6oz_OS_Craisins_Cherry_front_00002_0000026009__7585__1.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":5088578,\"image\":{\"width\":3000,\"height\":3000}},\"fileName\":\"6oz_OS_Craisins_Cherry_front(00002_0000026009)(7585)_1.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"gtin\":\"00031200002310\",\"size\":\"6 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"25HM9h0Q83PQTuF78KPjW0\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-10T19:02:39.192Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-05-07T14:44:40.699Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVers