,\"gtag\":\"G-CSHX9SKFN4\",\"gtmTest\":\"GTM-N8S9WFFH\",\"gtagTest\":\"G-LPKMNCGB2P\"}}],\"category\":\"[Circular]\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Bright Red\",\"destiniAssociationId\":\"CraisinsDriedCranberriesPomegranateJuiceInfused\",\"bvProductId\":\"76BF7D5D-9F61-4EAC-9D5E-C66589469F65\",\"curalateProductId\":\"76BF7D5D-9F61-4EAC-9D5E-C66589469F65-6 oz\",\"typeFilters\":[],\"dietaryFilters\":[],\"flavorFilters\":[],\"metaTitle\":\"Ocean Spray® Products: Craisins® Original Dried Cranberries - Pomegranate Juice Infused\",\"metaDescription\":\"Discover the enticing tangy sweetness of Ocean Spray® Craisins® Original Dried Cranberries, now infused with tantalizing pomegranate juice.\",\"metaKeywords\":\"Craisins Dried Cranberries, Craisins Dried Cranberries Pomegranate Juice Infused\",\"ogTitle\":\"\",\"upc\":\"76BF7D5D-9F61-4EAC-9D5E-C66589469F65\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{140DFDD5-681D-4AD5-BFD1-6FE7D673564D}\",\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"disclaimer\":\"No artificial colors, flavors or preservatives, Gluten Free, Peanut Free, Made from Real Fruit\"}},\"[Circular]\",{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"6S0lcHgXvvnzxoYmAmh0cX\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-13T13:24:19.942Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-01-16T09:46:18.683Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":100,\"revision\":16,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"product\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Craisins® Dried Cranberries Blueberry Juice Infused\",\"slug\":\"craisins-dried-cranberries-blueberry-juice-infused-6-oz\",\"hubSpotLabel\":\"Craisins® Dried Cranberries Blueberry Juice Infused\",\"description\":{\"nodeType\":\"document\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Sweeten the day with Ocean Spray® Craisins® Blueberry Dried Cranberries. Mouth-watering flavor with uncanny nutrition. This cranberry dried fruit product is an easy way to work in 25% of your daily recommended fruit needs. No artificial flavors or preservatives. Enjoy real, bold dried cranberries infused with blueberry juice in every dried fruit pouch. Potent little puckers that are peanut-free, gluten-free and judgment-free. Top your weeknight salads. Mix them in your oatmeal or cereal. Use as baking ingredients in your favorite treats, like blueberry lemon cheesecake bars. Step up your entertaining game by adding their powerful flavor and color to apps, charcuterie boards and more. Transform boring lunches and snacks into something you look forward to eating. Can raisins do all that? Nope. They're also just really good on their own.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]}]},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"12KX88yRRYcDs4iOjsokFH\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:28:18.493Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:28:18.493Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Craisins® Dried Cranberries Blueberry Juice Infused\",\"description\":\"Craisins® Dried Cranberries Blueberry Juice Infused front image.\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/12KX88yRRYcDs4iOjsokFH/23c944e5045b152c2304eb798e2f9915/Craisins__Dried_Cranberries_Blueberry_Juice_Infused.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":1694884,\"image\":{\"width\":1000,\"height\":1400}},\"fileName\":\"Craisins® Dried Cranberries Blueberry Juice Infused.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"gtin\":\"00031200002327\",\"size\":\"6 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"s