ineapple cranberry blend and nuts!\",\"metaKeywords\":\"Craisins Dried Cranberries, Ocean Spray® Pineapple Cran™ Snack Medley\",\"ogTitle\":\"\",\"upc\":\"4F1019CE-38F1-4930-89C8-A142E6F2F3A3\",\"sitecoreId\":\"{4F1019CE-38F1-4930-89C8-A142E6F2F3A3}\",\"associatedRecipes\":[],\"disclaimer\":\"Made from real fruit\\r\\nNo artificial colors, flavors or preservatives\\r\\nNo high fructose corn syrup\\r\\nNo artificial sweeteners\\r\\n\"}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"5DCdk9v0XZYxk0xhHINSmi\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-13T13:25:35.868Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-01-16T09:56:07.147Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":65,\"revision\":17,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"product\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Mango Cran™ Snack Medley\",\"slug\":\"ocean-spray-mango-cran-snack-medley-5-1-oz\",\"hubSpotLabel\":\"Mango Cran™ Snack Medley\",\"description\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Big bold flavors. Perfectly portioned. Ocean Spray® Mango Cran™ Snack Medley. The cranberry flavor you know and love, paired with tropical mango for the ultimate sweet and tangy fruit snack experience. Enjoy a dried fruit snack pack anytime, anywhere. Lunch snacks at school. Afternoon bites on the way to practice. Late-night cravings on road trips. It's always the right time for these single serve snacks. Made from real fruit for the bold flavor of dried cranberries and dried mangos. Transform boring lunches into mic-dropping meals. Top your morning parfait. Mix them in your oatmeal or yogurt. Take them as nutritious on the go snacks during weekend errands. Other snacks couldn't keep up if they tried. However you eat them, don't let anything stand in the way of your Ocean Spray® Mango Cran™ Snack Medley fix. They're perfectly portioned, individual snacks for your busy life. Ocean Spray believes in the power of the mighty cranberry; Born Tart. Raised Bold.™\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"frontImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"dWHE5sVfFMUjlrCr5ASxl\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:30:48.552Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-12T19:30:48.552Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":2,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Ocean Spray® Mango Cran™ Snack Medley\",\"description\":\"Ocean Spray® Mango Cran™ Snack Medley front image.\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/dWHE5sVfFMUjlrCr5ASxl/80b9defd30292706348dfea395ca5fcc/Ocean_Spray__Mango_Cran__Snack_Medley.png\",\"details\":{\"size\":582946,\"image\":{\"width\":1000,\"height\":1400}},\"fileName\":\"Ocean Spray® Mango Cran™ Snack Medley.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\"}}},\"gtin\":\"00031200022882\",\"size\":\"5/1 oz\",\"nutritionalInfoImage\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"75e2GDKVB0Q10miBQtu6T5\",\"type\":\"Asset\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-10T18:38:58.241Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-09-10T18:38:58.241Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":6,\"revision\":1,\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\" 5-1oz OS Mango Cran Medley NFP(00002 0000015166)(4860) 1 Ingredients\",\"description\":\"Image for  5-1oz OS Mango Cran Medley NFP(00002 0000015166)(4860) 1 Ingredients\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"/ctf/img/fk5croonv4b3/75e2GDKVB0Q10miBQtu6T5/de6