ur cran flag high. Join now and get access to exclusive offers, the latest news from the bog, and new product sneak peeks.\",\"newsletterTermsConditionsText\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim\\n\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"legalHeading\":\"©2024 Ocean Spray\",\"destini\":\"oceanspray\",\"bazaarVoice\":\"oceanspray\",\"curalate\":\"oceanspray-g0frjz\",\"bazaarVoiceSiteId\":\"main_site\",\"engineId\":\"j-As7u-eo3_Qc-Xhor-A\",\"gtm\":\"GTM-M7VQVSDN\",\"gtag\":\"G-CSHX9SKFN4\",\"gtmTest\":\"GTM-N8S9WFFH\",\"gtagTest\":\"G-LPKMNCGB2P\"}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"33OayDNwRjRzTBqQBF3Y97\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-08-16T15:34:17.494Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-07-16T13:42:47.439Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":11,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"country\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"name\":\"Chile\",\"tld\":\"cl\",\"countryCode\":\"CL\",\"languages\":[],\"headerMenus\":[],\"footerMenus\":[],\"newsletterHeading\":\"In Cran We Trust\",\"newsletterText\":\"Wave your cran flag high. Join now and get access to exclusive offers, the latest news from the bog, and new product sneak peeks.\",\"newsletterTermsConditionsText\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim\\n\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"legalHeading\":\"©2024 Ocean Spray\",\"destini\":\"oceanspray\",\"bazaarVoice\":\"oceanspray\",\"curalate\":\"oceanspray-g0frjz\",\"bazaarVoiceSiteId\":\"main_site\",\"engineId\":\"j-As7u-eo3_Qc-Xhor-A\",\"gtm\":\"GTM-M7VQVSDN\",\"gtag\":\"G-CSHX9SKFN4\",\"gtmTest\":\"GTM-N8S9WFFH\",\"gtagTest\":\"G-LPKMNCGB2P\"}}],\"slug\":\"about-us/our-purpose\",\"title\":\"Ocean Spray Our Purpose\",\"description\":\"Laddering to our purpose, our values are the foundation for how our team members work together and treat each other—how we behave as a cooperative and as a citizen of this planet. Unique to who we are as an agricultural cooperative, we strive to live our values everyday.\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Off White\",\"heroModule\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"1KdT8teAK2K5WfQjDAuwLS\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-27T15:11:03.552Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-08-07T19:56:46.811Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":178,\"revision\":4,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"moduleHeroStory\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"internalName\":\"Our Purpose Hero\",\"variant\":\"About the Harvest\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Magenta\",\"headingLine1\":\"Our\",\"headingLine2\":\"Purpose\"}},\"modules\":[{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"E7lJi2aSRNueAVsiVdk4N\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-27T15:28:39.174Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-08-14T07:58:16.379Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":184,\"revision\":4,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"textModule\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"internalName\":\"Our Purpose - Tom Hayes Quote\",\"variant\":\"Quote\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Bright Red\",\"heading\":\"Connecting Farms to Families\",\"bodyText\":\"“As a farmer-owned agricultural cooperative and globally recognized brand, we have a unique and wonderful opportunity to make a lasting and positive difference across the world. Connecting Our Farms to Families for a Better Life is more than just a company purpose statement—it’s the foundation for our strategic direction, shaping who we are, and want to be, as an organization.”\",\"attribution\":\"Tom Hayes, President and CEO\"}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"6LjfEiCRA9TUywkU5CszVO\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-27T15:26:52.305Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-08-07T19:57:05.613Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":187,\"revision\":4,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"textModule\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"internalName\":\"Our Purpose Copy\",\"variant\":\"Long Copy\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Off White\",\"heading\":\"Purpose and Values\",\"bodyText\":\"Laddering to our purpose, our values are the foundation for how our team members work together and treat each other—how we behave as a cooperative and as a citizen of this planet. Unique to who we are as an agricultural cooperative, we strive to live these values every day:\\n\\nGROWER MINDSET: We embrace our farmer-owners' innovative spirit and heritage through confidence, learning, and focus on the future.\\n\\nSUSTAINABLE RESULTS: Guided by purpose, we are focused on delivering results for our farmer-owners.\\n\\nINTEGRITY ABOVE ALL: We are ethical, doing the right thing for our farmer-owners, customers, consumers, and each other.\\n\\nINCLUSIVE TEAMWORK: We build diverse and inclusive teams that strengthen our cooperative.\"}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"3ZXMMZzH0qs0dL500u98oo\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-27T15:36:47.874Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-05-06T16:57:05.403Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":226,\"revision\":9,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"textAndImageModule\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"internalName\":\"Our Purpose - Cooperative Sustainability Report\",\"variant\":\"Layered Evergreen - Text Right\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Red\",\"heading\":\"COOPERATIVE SUSTAINABILITY REPORT\",\"bodyText\":\"Ocean Spray’s Cooperative Sustainability Report and Strategy has four critical pillars: Planet, Product, People, and Prosperity. These pillars keep us aligned to our purpose and values, so we remain a regenerative and resilient cooperative for generations to come.\",\"selectIllustration\":\"Juice Bottle\"}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}}],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"SeveGjLnVLSw3Zr03pOfJ\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-27T15:55:40.462Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-08-07T19:58:02.120Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":189,\"revision\":5,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"moduleContentGrid\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"internalName\":\"Our Purpose - Grid\",\"variant\":\"Resources Grid\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Off White\",\"selectIllustration\":\"Cranberries (Three)\",\"heading\":\"Our Commitment\",\"cards\":[]}},{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"space\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Space\",\"id\":\"fk5croonv4b3\"}},\"id\":\"6QjbcQMYyf3J24mjKL4AKl\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-04-30T19:33:26.814Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-23T07:17:43.930Z\",\"environment\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"master\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Environment\"}},\"publishedVersion\":25,\"revision\":6,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"textModule\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"internalName\":\"Community Fund - CTA\",\"variant\":\"Evergreen\",\"backgroundColor\":\"Dark Green\",\"heading\":\"Community Fund\",\"bodyText\":\"Ocean Spray’s farmer-owners and team members deeply value the importance of supporting the communities where we live and work. Giving back is part of our culture and passion.\\n\\n \\nThrough our Community Impact Grant Program, the Ocean Spray Community Fund provides resources to organizations that improve the quality of life in our farmer communities. We are proud to partner with organizations raising up their local communities and families. The application is currently closed, but will reopen in the spring for our annual grant award period.\",\"selectIllustration\":\"Cranberries (Bunch)\",\"selectStamp\":\"For the Love of Cran\",\"stamp\":true,\"illustration\":true}}]}},\"openInNewWindow\":false,\"download\":false}}}]},{\"internalName\":\"Our Farmers Menu - US Only\",\"heading\":\"Our Farmers\",\"links\":[{\"id\":\"cab94beb-9626-49ca-bfa8-18940d78d14b\",\"linkEntryId\":\"786upJ3ad6nlcDO5ak0ySC\",\"imageAssetEntryId\":\"\",\"associatedEntryId\":\"786upJ3ad6nlcDO5ak0ySC\",\"linkEntry\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"uk\"}},{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Tag\",\"id\":\"us\"}